texts spaceToolDetailDescription
	(SpaceGame_Commodities!0x1556a1b1) "This artifact was commonly found on the back porch of Epic caverns.  Epic creatures used these to scrape the mud off of their feet before entering their home.  They called it a boot scraper, even though they didn't wear boots.  Now *that's* foresight."
end
